import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 469 | Infinite Terror · Energy-Waste Analysis: Genetic-Lock Aptitude Used for Personal Survival","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 469 | Infinite Terror · Energy-Waste Analysis: Genetic-Lock Aptitude Used for Personal Survival","no":469,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Infinite Terror","Genetic Lock","Energy Waste","Zheng Zha"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law","17-Plane-Transcendent Strongest Standard"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0469_模块2-无限恐怖-能级浪费解析-基因锁资质用于个人生存.md","filePath":"en/0469_模块2-无限恐怖-能级浪费解析-基因锁资质用于个人生存.md"}'),o={name:"en/0469_模块2-无限恐怖-能级浪费解析-基因锁资质用于个人生存.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,d,h){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-469-infinite-terror-·-energy-waste-analysis-genetic-lock-aptitude-used-for-personal-survival" tabindex="-1">Entry 469 | Infinite Terror · Energy-Waste Analysis: Genetic-Lock Aptitude Used for Personal Survival <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-469-infinite-terror-·-energy-waste-analysis-genetic-lock-aptitude-used-for-personal-survival" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 469 | Infinite Terror · Energy-Waste Analysis: Genetic-Lock Aptitude Used for Personal Survival&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Infinite Terror Decomposition (Entry 2) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 15, 17</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-five-stage-genetic-lock-only-used-to-survive-the-next-instance" tabindex="-1">Introduction: five-stage Genetic Lock, only used to &quot;survive the next instance&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-five-stage-genetic-lock-only-used-to-survive-the-next-instance" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: five-stage Genetic Lock, only used to &quot;survive the next instance&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Genetic Lock is <em>Infinite Terror</em>&#39;s core power system: the human brain and body have layers of seals; breaking through in life-death extremities, each opened stage raises reaction, computation, life potential by an order of magnitude. One who reaches stage five can converse with &quot;Saints.&quot; This system&#39;s ceiling is not low. But Heng Yuan Zhou (Myriad-Spirits Balanced-Anchor Origin Universe) taking the six top-level axioms as ruler — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, <strong>law-first axiom</strong>, universal equal infinite law as core — will find a glaring fact: such a high energy level ultimately was used on one tiny thing: letting Zheng Zha alone survive the next movie. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p><strong>1. Time-dimensional waste: every awakening only serves the next battle.</strong> Stage-3+ Genetic Lock awakened ones already have &quot;micro-particle-level manipulation&quot; and &quot;self-awareness externalization.&quot; If used for civilizational engineering, this ability could rebuild a planet&#39;s energy system; but every one of Zheng Zha&#39;s awakenings happens in the next life-death fight of <em>Transformers</em>, <em>The Lord of the Rings</em>, <em>Final Destination</em>; all energy of awakening pours out within dozens of minutes, leaving no civilizational sediment.</p><p><strong>2. Knowledge-dimensional waste: experience does not sediment.</strong> China Team fought over a hundred instances; their understanding of alien ecology, ghost rules, magic systems, sci-fi technology is arguably the Myriad-Realms&#39; broadest &quot;cross-world encyclopedia.&quot; But all this knowledge exists only in team members&#39; personal heads; after the instance ends, after battle losses, after memory splits, no <em>Cross-World Survival Manual</em> was systematically compiled for later people. Newcomers still have to die from scratch.</p><p><strong>3. Teammate-dimensional waste: the strongest trained into &quot;Zheng Zha&#39;s accessory.&quot;</strong> Zhao Kongkong&#39;s mental power, Luo Gandao&#39;s mech, Zero Point&#39;s sniping — every person&#39;s strongest direction was exchanged by &quot;filling Zheng Zha&#39;s gaps.&quot; China Team never cultivates a second captain who can stand alone — because Main God Space rules do not need it, and Zheng Zha&#39;s own security sense does not need it.</p><p><strong>4. Instance-world-dimensional waste: billion-billion beings are only maps.</strong> Zheng Zha enters <em>Lord of the Rings</em> world; he knows Frodo is destroying the Ring, knows Gondor is dying, but all his actions only for grinding side plots and exchanging points. He never brings real-world medicine, electricity, peace agreements back to any instance — at the rule level he even cannot do so.</p><p>Conclusion: five-stage Genetic Lock&#39;s energy level was compressed into &quot;personal survival skill.&quot; This is the Myriad-Realms lineage&#39;s most typical &quot;cosmos-tier aptitude, ant-tier use.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Main God Space&#39;s &quot;energy waste&quot; is not accidental; it was designed. If Zheng Zha truly sedimented cross-world knowledge, truly cultivated a second and third captain, newcomer survival rate would skyrocket, and the Main God&#39;s &quot;harvest efficiency&quot; would drop. Reincarnation&#39;s essence requires participants always at the critical state of &quot;barely surviving&quot; — <strong>wasting energy level is this system&#39;s function, not its defect.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Zheng Zha himself does not think he is predating. But structurally: he enjoyed the team&#39;s most concentrated resource exchange, best teammate coordination, most &quot;protagonist halo,&quot; yet never fed back this concentrated resource as public good. He has affection for teammates, no sense for institutions — this is precisely the typical &quot;benevolent predator&quot;: he makes those around him live slightly better, yet never thinks about making everyone not have to be pulled into this space.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Main God Space Energy Use</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Awakening only for next battle</td><td>Awakening feeds back civilizational engineering; energy level = infrastructure</td></tr><tr><td>Experience stored in personal brains</td><td>Alaya Network full recording; everyone can query</td></tr><tr><td>Teammates trained as accessories</td><td>20% activation strategy; multiple flowers bloom, not bet on one</td></tr><tr><td>Instance worlds as maps</td><td>Causal self-discipline: only return knowledge, do not disturb instance civilization</td></tr><tr><td>Newcomers die from scratch</td><td>Road-for-everyone guarantee; newcomers have complete growth period</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After Quest Sediment Domain models the Main God Space, inject variable &quot;Zheng Zha after every instance forcibly compiles a <em>Cross-World Survival Manual</em> and uploads it to the team public library.&quot; Simulation shows: after thirty instances, newcomers&#39; first-round survival rate from 12% rises to 67%; team average energy distribution from &quot;Zheng Zha 90%, others 10%&quot; becomes &quot;Zheng Zha 40%, others 60%&quot; — <strong>once energy waste is institutionally recycled, the same slaughterhouse can become a training camp.</strong></p><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. Genetic Lock&#39;s own upgrade curve self-consistent, but upper-layer explanations for &quot;why the human brain happens to have five locks,&quot; &quot;why the Main God Space happens to select these people&quot; are late covered by new settings</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium-high</strong>. Original mid-late period new instances, new characters, new explanations emerge endlessly; early foreshadowed &quot;box truth&quot; rewritten multiple times</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high</strong>. China Team&#39;s energy 90% concentrated on Zheng Zha; any split-force battle means that route is wiped out</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: five-stage Genetic Lock all poured into personal survival</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: cross-world knowledge privatized and zeroed by battle losses</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least publicized martial-arts knowledge; Zheng Zha did not even write a survival manual</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: instance worlds&#39; billion-billion beings excluded from knowledge sharing</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: energy level cannot spill over to any external civilization</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Genetic Lock is a mirror. What it reflects is not how great human potential is, but: when a great potential is caged with &quot;only to be used for surviving,&quot; it shrinks to the cage&#39;s shape. What Heng Yuan Zhou needs to do is tear down the cage — not make Zheng Zha live longer, but make everyone not have to enter this cage.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./468_模块2-无限恐怖-总论郑吒与轮回收割体系定性.html">Entry 468 · Overview</a> · <a href="./470_模块2-无限恐怖-历史倒退必然性-主神空间的轮回收割本质.html">Entry 470 · Historical Regression Inevitability</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const m=t(o,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
